Assumption challenge
Candidate vertices considered: curve points, square corners, diagonal pairs, D4 orbits, runners, danger arcs, endpoint owners, Toeplitz modes, packet sidecar fields, and proof obligations.
Chosen vertices are proof obligations because they preserve strict LRC witness status and named residual handoff; raw square corners and raw Toeplitz moments forget scale, owner names, and collapse mode.

